# Odd seven: U2's ROM word $3EE (TABLE + 7, the glyph of 7) has bit 3 (segment d) stuck at 1: every 7 is drawn with a bottom bar.
machine bw1
title "Odd seven"
brief "Every 7 the BW-1 shows has a bar along its bottom. AD 0277 shows it twice; the other digits look right."
fault cell U2.D3 rom $3EE 1
